      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "KREA2 ANYPAINT - INPAINT\n\n1) Load your image, right-click it > Open in MaskEditor,\n   paint the area to regenerate (painted = redrawn, rest kept).\n2) Write the prompt for the WHOLE image, not just the masked part.\n3) Queue.\n\nPadding on Prepare is all 0 = pure inpaint. Add padding to\noutpaint at the same time.\n\nboundary_redraw_px (32): how far past the mask edge gets\nreblended. Raise it if seams show.\n\nThe masked area is redrawn at full strength (denoise 1).\nThere is no partial-strength / denoise dial like Crop & Stitch."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
